We have two guests today. First is Dr. Dean McKay, a professor in the Department of Psychology at Fordham University, where he heads the compulsive, obsessive, and anxiety program laboratory. Dr. McKay's research focuses on the nature and treatment of obsessive compulsive disorder, as well as anxiety disorders, and the role of disgust in psychopathology. He has edited or co-edited 21 books and published more than 300 journal articles and book chapters. He is also a board certified clinical psychologist and director and founder of the Institute for Cognitive Behavior Therapy and Research, a private treatment and research center in New York. He is a past president of both a society for the science of clinical psychology and the association for behavioral and cognitive therapies.
今天我们有两位嘉宾。第一位是福特汉姆大学心理学系教授迪恩·麦凯博士，他负责强迫、焦虑项目实验室。麦凯博士的研究重点是强迫症的本质和治疗，以及焦虑症和厌恶感在精神病理学中的作用。他编辑或合编了21本书，发表了300多篇期刊文章和书籍章节。他也是一位获得委员会认证的临床心理学家，以及纽约一家私人治疗和研究中心——认知行为治疗与研究中心的创始人和主任。他曾担任临床心理科学学会和行为与认知疗法协会的主席。

