about OCD that you encounter and how do they differ from the actual disorder? One of the most common ones. You touched on it in the introduction that OCD is mainly expressed through meticulousness, orderliness, punctuality. Maybe every now and then someone will remark that they have some kind of proneness to checking something, that these seem to be the net and some total of what is OCDs. And that is a pretty dramatic and common misconception. One that among OCD experts, we kind of find an unfortunate one because it really trivializes the severity of this condition.
它们与实际的疾病有何不同？最常见的一个，你在介绍中提到了，即强迫症主要表现为一丝不苟、井井有条、守时。也许偶尔有人会说他们有某种检查东西的倾向，这些似乎就是强迫症的全部。这是一个非常戏剧化且常见的误解。在强迫症专家看来，这是一种不幸的误解，因为它真的淡化了这种疾病的严重性。

